WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:02.700
Hello, my name is Eduardo from Terra Tanks.

00:03.000 --> 00:04.800
We sell stock tank pools in Australia.

00:05.400 --> 00:07.400
We've been struggling to figure out

00:07.500 --> 00:10.400
how to stay up to date with all of the

00:10.400 --> 00:12.900
AI SEO new developments.

00:13.100 --> 00:14.500
They changed so quickly,

00:14.600 --> 00:17.100
but luckily enough we met Ross

00:17.200 --> 00:20.500
and he was able to help us understand

00:20.500 --> 00:22.400
what we needed to do to rank highly

00:22.400 --> 00:24.900
in AI and Google AI,

00:24.900 --> 00:27.600
and thankfully we've done much better

00:27.600 --> 00:28.900
since we started working with them

00:28.900 --> 00:30.800
and it's really helped our brand.

00:30.900 --> 00:32.600
We highly recommend it.
